From the datasheet, **LS-SM5506-80C** and **LS-SM5506-80I** differ only in case temperature (ordering table); both are **1550 nm** products with the same optical table. Transmitter centre wavelength is **1530–1570 nm**; receiver centre wavelength **1260–1610 nm** is acceptance on the same module, not a second selectable mode. Per your rules, one mode per model; assign the **transmitter** band (1530 / 1570) to each model—not the RX pair with 80I.

```json
{
  "modes": [
    {
      "label": "LS-SM5506-80C Standard temp",
      "model": "LS-SM5506-80C",
      "wavelength_min_nm": 1530.0,
      "wavelength_max_nm": 1570.0
    },
    {
      "label": "LS-SM5506-80I Industrial temp",
      "model": "LS-SM5506-80I",
      "wavelength_min_nm": 1530.0,
      "wavelength_max_nm": 1570.0
    }
  ]
}
```
